#: svelte/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A Vite + Svelte app styled with [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components)\n"
"and [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) "
"(icon action + token reads).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` calls `register()` (from `@pantoken/svelte`) once at "
"bootstrap so elements like\n"
"  `<instui-icon>` work in templates, and imports the token CSS plus "
"`@pantoken/interactions`\n"
"  (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component behaviors out of the box).\n"
"- `src/App.svelte`'s markup is styled with `instui-*` classes; optional "
"insertion points (header,\n"
"  filters, content, trailing) are marked with `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"He taupānga Vite + Svelte kua whakatakotoritia ki te āhua mā [`@pantoken/"
"components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) me "
"[`@pantoken/svelte`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) (mahi "
"tohu + pānui tohu).\n"
"\n"
"## Whakawhanake\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## He aha kei konei\n"
"\n"
"- Ka karangahia e `src/main.ts` te `register()` (no `@pantoken/svelte`) "
"kotahi i te tīmatanga kia mahi ai ngā wāhanga pērā i `<instui-icon>` i roto "
"i ngā hemo, ā, ka kawemai hoki i te CSS tohu me `@pantoken/interactions` (ka "
"hono ngā mōhiohio pērā i te kōtaha matapihi, taputapu tohu, me ētahi atu "
"whanonga wāhanga i te tūnga).\n"
"- Ko te tohu ā-anga a `src/App.svelte` kua āta hoahoa ki ngā karaehe `instui-"
"*`; kua tohu āwhina urunga kōwhiringa (upoko, tātari, ihirangi, "
"whakamutunga) ki te `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Whakamahia ngā karaehe pēnei i te `class=\"instui-button\"` ki ngā tohu; "
"tirohia te [tohu wāhanga](https://pantoken.app/api/css) mō te rārangi "
"karaehe katoa.\n"
"\n"
"## Akohia atu\n"
"\n"
"Tirohia te [aratohu tīmata](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) kia "
"ako atu.\n"

