#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"He taupānga TypeScript mārama (mā Vite) kua hoahoatia ki\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"ā, e whakamahi ana i\n"
"ngā wāhanga ritenga kore-takotoranga taputapu mai i\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Whakawhanake\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## He aha kei konei\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` ka kawemai i `@pantoken/css` (e tautuhi ana i ia `--instui-"
"*` taonga ritenga),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` ngā "
"karaehe),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (e hono ana ngā whanonga pērā i te modal, "
"tooltip, me ētahi atu wahanga, i te taunoa), ā, `@pantoken/web-components` "
"(ka rēhita aunoa i ngā element pērā i `<instui-icon>`), katahi ka tāngia te "
"tohu ki `#app`.\n"
"- Ngā wāhi tāpiri kōwhiringa (header, filters, content, trailing) kua tohua "
"ki\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — whakakapi i ō rātou ihirangi mā ōu ake tohu.\n"
"- Whakamahia ngā element ritenga tika i roto i te tohu, hei tauira `<instui-"
"button>`, `<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  tirohia te [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/"
"package/@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  mō te rārangi katoa o ngā element.\n"
"\n"
"## Ako atu anō\n"
"\n"
"Tirohia te [aratohu HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) kia ako atu "
"anō.\n"
